Short:        Pllb-C2P (chunky to planar) System
Author:       uwdesign@lin.cbl.com.au (Kevin Picone)
Uploader:     uwdesign&lin cbl com au (Kevin Picone)
Type:         dev/asm
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

                            Pllb-c2p V1.06
                            ==============

            (Precalc Linear Lookup Blitter - Chunky To Planar)


                       Released: 10th-8-1996


 Features: 
 =========

                  * Linear Chunky Frame Buffer

                  * Single, Double & Quad Pixel widths are supported

                  * Uses Normal (none resorted) chunky Pixels

                  * 256/64/16 Colour Versions

                  * Various Conversion methods
                      
                           *Normal 
                           *Delta
                           *Null Skip
                           *Delta Null Skip

                  * 16bit conversion with 32bit Writes To Chipram

  
 Special Requirements:
 =====================


                  * ECS/AGA Blitter for long blits.

                  * Fastram for Precalc buffer (from 512k -> 2meg ;)


 New Features Since V1.05:
 =========================


                  * None, just fixed up some assembler compatibility problems
                    within the main source.  Hence, it should now assemble
                    correctly with any asssembler.
